      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "Small field but great race. LIGHT THE NIGHT (6) is going great guns this campaign with a fresh-up win followed by a narrow loss here last time. Has a strong record at this course and distance. Down in weight and will be tough to stop. THE COSMIC ONE (1) is still in first campaign but seemingly unstoppable, winning five of seven runs. The latest was open class when led throughout. Has won 3/4 this course and distance. Back in grade but shoots up 7kg on the win and will face some pressure early so this is another acid test. JACKS ON ICE (4) could be his undoing. Another speedster in good form, leading throughout last time here in easier grade. That was a good form race with the likes of Talisay in his wake. Take running down again. DANCING STORM (5) was placed behind THE COSMIC ONE last time and is drawn to stalk the leaders. Among the chances. TEARDROP ROTATION (7) rates highly and can do much better this time.",
